# The console's own menu, opened with the home button on the home screen:
# the brightness steps and the BOOT ANIM setting.
# Run: --boot full --fps 30 --frames 330
#
# --boot full so the menu's BOOT ANIM line shows the default value, FULL.
# 0-81:    the GATHER boot animation plays (no key, so it is not skipped)
# 81-109:  the home screen stands still
110 press home
111 release home
# 111: the console menu: brightness (sun and five bars, all lit), BOOT ANIM:
#      FULL, CLOSE; the gear at the right end of the bottom bar is lit.
#      BRIGHTNESS is chosen.
# 135-171: left three times (five bars to two), then right three times
#          (back to five)
135 press left
136 release left
147 press left
148 release left
159 press left
160 release left
177 press right
178 release right
189 press right
190 release right
201 press right
202 release right
# 220: down to BOOT ANIM; OK three times: SHORT, OFF, FULL again
220 press down
221 release down
236 press south
237 release south
252 press south
253 release south
268 press south
269 release south
# 285: down to CLOSE, 298: OK closes the menu
285 press down
286 release down
298 press south
299 release south
# 299-329: the home screen again, the gear no longer lit
